Task 4: Spam SMS Detection

Objective:
Build a machine learning model to classify SMS messages as Spam or Ham using text processing techniques.

Description:
This project uses TF-IDF vectorization to convert SMS text into numerical features and applies a
Naive Bayes classifier to detect spam messages. The model performance is evaluated using accuracy,
classification report, and confusion matrix.

Tools & Technologies:
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn

Dataset:
spam.csv

Model Used:
- Multinomial Naive Bayes

Results:
Accuracy: 97.8%

Status:
Completed
